The_Crazies_are_very_social_animals._They_live_in_large_groups_called_"suffles"_and_feed_mainly_on_small_rodents_and_bugs._To_fend_off_possible_predators,_a_suffle_of_Crazies_will_stack_on_top_of_one_another,_forming_a_giant_totem-pole-like_structure_and_begin_clicking._END
